FFmpeg Transcode Commands:
Transcoded files will be stored in: /var/mnt/main/media_transcoded

These commands will transcode your files for optimal Jellyfin direct play while maintaining quality.

Setup:
mkdir -p /var/mnt/main/media_transcoded

mkdir -p /var/mnt/main/media_transcoded/tv/Grey's Anatomy/Season 15
File: Grey's Anatomy - S15E03 - Gut Feeling WEBDL-1080p.mkv
Command:
ffmpeg -i "/var/mnt/main/media/tv/Grey's Anatomy/Season 15/Grey's Anatomy - S15E03 - Gut Feeling WEBDL-1080p.mkv" -map 0 -c:v h264 -preset slow -crf 18 -profile:v high -level 4.1 -pix_fmt yuv8p -c:a aac -b:a 384k -ac🅰0 6 -ac🅰1 2 
-c:s copy -f mp4 "/var/mnt/main/media_transcoded/tv/Grey's Anatomy/Season 15/Grey's Anatomy - S15E03 - Gut Feeling WEBDL-1080p.transcoding.mp4"
mv "/var/mnt/main/media_transcoded/tv/Grey's Anatomy/Season 15/Grey's Anatomy - S15E03 - Gut Feeling WEBDL-1080p.transcoding.mp4" "/var/mnt/main/media_transcoded/tv/Grey's Anatomy/Season 15/Grey's Anatomy - S15E03 - Gut Feeling 
WEBDL-1080p.mp4"

