Notes:
1. Transcoded files will maintain the same directory structure in the new location
2. Original files remain untouched
3. In Jellyfin, you can:
   a. Add both libraries but give transcoded versions higher priority
   b. Or only add the transcoded library for affected content
4. H.264 High Profile Level 4.1 ensures wide device compatibility
5. CRF 18 provides visually lossless quality
6. For surround sound, both original and stereo downmix are included
7. Subtitles are converted to SRT when possible for better timing

To transcode all files, you can save these commands to a script:
./scripts/transcode_inventory.py generate-transcode-commands > transcode_commands.sh
chmod +x transcode_commands.sh
./transcode_commands.sh
